  "contract": "A parent run's description while its children are open (published Server 2.11.5 WorkflowController::show with Workflow 2.15.1 RunWaitView), over raw worker HTTP on protocol 1.20 in a fresh namespace. Each case completes the parent's first workflow task with child and timer commands and records the description. A parent with two open children is described as waiting for a child; with an open child and an open timer, in either order, as waiting for the timer; and a child under parent_close_policy terminate is described like any other. An open activity is likewise described ahead of open children, in either order. A child requesting cancellation_policy try_cancel from a worker that does not declare cooperative cancellation is refused 409 child_cancellation_policy_not_supported. Embedded applications have no worker protocol.",
